&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Journalism, Election Security, and Public Service: A Conversation with Barton Gellman&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Barton Gellman&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is a three-time Pulitzer Prize winner as a national security correspondent for the Washington Post; author of the Atlantic article &amp;quot;The Election that Could Break America&amp;quot;; and now a senior adviser at the Brennan Center for Social Justice. He will be in conversation with &lt;strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Prof. Keith Gessen&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;. Reception to follow.&lt;/p&gt;
