&lt;p&gt;The March 31 seminar has moderator&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;Stefano Fusi&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Professor of Neuroscience; Principal Investigator&amp;nbsp;&lt;br /&gt;
at the Zuckerman Mind Brain Behavior Institute, Columbia University) in conversation with two Italian Academy Fellows.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Fellows and their projects are:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://italianacademy.columbia.edu/directory/paul-linton"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paul Linton&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
